<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Now I share Thy human life, Lord,</l><l>Filled with Thy humanity,</l><l>All of Thy complete obedience</l><l>Is available to me.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>One with Thee in crucifixion,</l><l>On the cross I died in Thee;</l><l>I am dead unto the world, Lord,</l><l>And the world is dead to me.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>One with Thee in resurrection,</l><l>Risen now to live in Thee,</l><l>With that life which is Thyself, Lord,</l><l>Now in me, Lord, even me.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>One with Thee in Thine ascension,</l><l>In the heavens now with Thee;</l><l>Here a pilgrim and a stranger,</l><l>My true life is hid in Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>One with Thee in Thine enthronement,</l><l>Sharing Thine authority,</l><l>Even as I share Thy life, Lord,</l><l>I in Thee and Thou in me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
